sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as React Chat Window
    participant API as chat_api.py (session_completion)
    participant Search as Search Engine
    participant LLM as LLM Streaming Service
    participant DB as MySQL DB (chat_dialog)

    UI->>API: POST /v1/session/completion (stream=true)
    API->>Search: Search Dealer -> Hybrid Search + Rerank
    Search-->>API: Chunks & Citation Metadata
    API->>UI: SSE Header & Citation Metadata Frame
    
    loop Stream Output
        LLM->>API: Yield Token Delta
        API->>UI: SSE Data Frame: data: {"code": 0, "data": {"answer": delta}}
    end

    API->>DB: INSERT INTO chat_dialog (answer, citations, tokens)
    API->>UI: SSE Data Frame: data: true
